{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00196",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.12,
      "end_seconds": 4.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Morning. Nice to finally see you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.68,
      "end_seconds": 9.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.82,
      "end_seconds": 22.27,
      "duration_seconds": 12.45,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling low most days, doctor. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.17,
      "end_seconds": 25.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.78,
      "end_seconds": 38.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.69,
      "text": "So, about... well, six months. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I've had poor appetite too, um, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.77,
      "end_seconds": 42.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Mm-hm. I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.68,
      "end_seconds": 45.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.45,
      "end_seconds": 51.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Any panic attacks, periods of unusually high energy or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.91,
      "end_seconds": 59.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "No panic attacks, periods of unusually high energy or weight loss, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.0,
      "end_seconds": 61.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Any hearing voices?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.09,
      "end_seconds": 65.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Not at all, no hearing voices."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.79,
      "end_seconds": 68.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.27,
      "end_seconds": 71.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "It's thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.69,
      "end_seconds": 74.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.62,
      "end_seconds": 78.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.96,
      "end_seconds": 82.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.47,
      "end_seconds": 100.79,
      "duration_seconds": 17.32,
      "text": "Okay, so not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.79,
      "end_seconds": 102.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.21,
      "end_seconds": 105.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.08,
      "end_seconds": 107.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.05,
      "end_seconds": 112.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.8,
      "end_seconds": 116.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.22,
      "end_seconds": 118.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.15,
      "end_seconds": 129.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.42,
      "end_seconds": 132.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Yes, shellfish. I get vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.27,
      "end_seconds": 136.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.82,
      "end_seconds": 145.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "I've, I've had an underactive thyroid for two years now. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.73,
      "end_seconds": 155.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "Mm. Right, so that's your known an underactive thyroid. We'll keep that in mind today. Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.7,
      "end_seconds": 158.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.89,
      "end_seconds": 164.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Right, what about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.24,
      "end_seconds": 167.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Well, my mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.11,
      "end_seconds": 173.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.9,
      "end_seconds": 183.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.34,
      "end_seconds": 202.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, pulse is 86 beats a minute, pressure 111 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.63,
      "end_seconds": 205.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.52,
      "end_seconds": 211.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.27,
      "end_seconds": 216.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.46,
      "end_seconds": 220.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.27,
      "end_seconds": 238.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "You're well kempt and speaking clearly, and you maintain good eye contact."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.4,
      "end_seconds": 240.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.96,
      "end_seconds": 255.97,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with a depressive episode. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.32,
      "end_seconds": 260.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Well, you know, doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.99,
      "end_seconds": 277.56,
      "duration_seconds": 15.57,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a depressive episode is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling low most days for six months, and no weight loss or hearing voices."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.62,
      "end_seconds": 281.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "So, um, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.09,
      "end_seconds": 296.33,
      "duration_seconds": 13.24,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.8,
      "end_seconds": 299.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.02,
      "end_seconds": 307.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Let's get a thyroid test, for low mood. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.01,
      "end_seconds": 310.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.66,
      "end_seconds": 317.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for low mood. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.55,
      "end_seconds": 320.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.65,
      "end_seconds": 331.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.79,
      "text": "Let's use sertraline, 25 milligrams, once a day, for one week then review. It's for depression. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.48,
      "end_seconds": 335.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.22,
      "end_seconds": 365.54,
      "duration_seconds": 26.32,
      "text": "It usually takes a few weeks for the tablet to start helping, so give it time and stay in touch. Try to keep some routine, a bit of daylight and a short walk each day. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. If you have thoughts of harming yourself, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.25,
      "end_seconds": 368.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.81,
      "end_seconds": 374.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.41,
      "end_seconds": 386.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "So, you know, I take the sertraline, 25 milligrams, once a day and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.0,
      "end_seconds": 390.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.95,
      "end_seconds": 396.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}